WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.455
Welcome to Module 4 of The Zero
Trust Assessment as Evidence:

2
00:00:04.455 --> 00:00:07.275
reconcile, re-run and keep the evidence.

3
00:00:07.275 --> 00:00:09.100
A single run is a reading.

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.985
A program needs the readings over
time, lined up with the other tools,

5
00:00:12.985 --> 00:00:16.038
and sealed so an assessor
can check them months later.

6
00:00:16.038 --> 00:00:17.788
This module does all three.

7
00:00:17.788 --> 00:00:22.575
It covers Steps 9 and 10 of the Zero
Trust Assessment implementation guide,

8
00:00:22.575 --> 00:00:25.730
takes about fifty minutes,
and finishes the path.
